  "note": "Election of members of Ballymoney Urban District Council in January 1932; only eleven candidates were nominated for the twelve vacancies and all were returned unopposed. Two old members did not seek re-election; W. B. Wallace was the only new candidate. One seat was left unfilled. Returned unopposed."
